    {
      "id": "648a980f-e628-4a1b-b10f-01931c2c8483",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 1,
      "content": "ABOUT THE MAJOR As a psychology major at Fresno Pacific University, you will learn to think in new ways as you examine people from scientific, religious, philosophical, physiological and socio-cultural perspectives. A hands-on approach to your learning provides a unique experience. Learn from faculty with a range of clinical training and perspectives as you study human behavior and mental processes in a theoretical and applied manner. Take your studies beyond the classroom with research projects and experiences observing and working in the field of psychology. **Agreement does not include all required courses for the major at FPU** This agreement lists courses that are prerequisites or may be completed prior to transfer to satisfy major requirements. All transfer courses must be completed with a grade of C- or better, and students must complete a minimum of 18 units in the major at FPU. Please contact an academic advisor to discuss the recommended sequence of courses, including courses that may count for both GE and major requirements. To view the full degree requirements, please refer to the Undergraduate Catalog: https://catalog.fresno.edu/index.php .",
      "contentHtml": "<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(22, 43, 132); font-size: 14px;\">ABOUT THE MAJOR</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">As a psychology major at Fresno Pacific University, you will learn to think in new ways as you examine people from scientific, religious, philosophical, physiological and socio-cultural perspectives. A hands-on approach to your learning provides a unique experience. Learn from faculty with a range of clinical training and perspectives as you study human behavior and mental processes in a theoretical and applied manner. Take your studies beyond the classroom with research projects and experiences observing and working in the field of psychology.</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(169, 62, 58); font-size: 14px;\">﻿**Agreement does not include all required courses for the major at FPU**</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">This agreement lists courses that are prerequisites or may be completed prior to transfer to satisfy major requirements. All transfer courses must be completed with a grade of C- or better, and students must complete a minimum of 18 units in the major at FPU. Please contact an academic advisor to discuss the recommended sequence of courses, including courses that may count for both GE and major requirements.&nbsp;To view the full degree requirements, please refer to the Undergraduate Catalog: </span><a href=\"https://catalog.fresno.edu/index.php\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">https://catalog.fresno.edu/index.php</a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.</span></p>"
    }
